# A PIN IS OWNED DEBT: `<case>\t<file> <owner> <ticket>`, the file under the package's src/. The gate (tools/gate.sh
# `pins_said`) fails a pin with no owner and ticket, one whose file is gone, and one whose case passed in a
# row that ran its file and ended none — strike its line the day its case passes.
# std-avrac's cases a gate passes over: red on trunk on both paths (decl_grain) — take a line away the day its case passes.
# The cases the PROGRAM LAYER fails where the old path passed, as of the spec harness's move onto it
# (shown / refused_with / refusals / refused_at_run / judged ask the layer, no net). Each is a law the
# layer lacks, a program it does not make, or an answer it gets wrong. THE LIST ONLY SHRINKS: take a
# line away the day its case passes.
# A case past a trap tools/gate/std-avrac.traps lists has never run on the layer and is not here: the
# lane that fixes a trap runs that file and pins or fixes what then reports.
compiler/subset — syntax the grammar lacks / syntax the grammar lacks / a list spreads only into its own element type	compiler/tests/subset/refusals_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/cells / a generic enum at a cell seat / a payload-less variant of another enum refuses by name, not by a defect	features/cells/tests/cells_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/components — type parameters / an event whose seat wears the parameter / names the pinned handler type when a handler does not fit	features/components/tests/components_generic_test.av ui-lead .195
features/enums (adversarial) / operators against an enum VALUE / a field read off an enum refuses	features/enums/tests/enums_adversarial_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/enums / generic enums — instantiation from the payload / a bare unit variant with no want cannot pin — nothing carries the type	features/enums/tests/enums_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/enums/patterns — a const's name compares / the hazard, binding half — the const is gone / an arm after `_` is told too, in the hole's words	features/enums/tests/const_pat_adversarial_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/expr_spine (type literal) — the red team / names against names / a spelling enum missing a shape names the missing variant	features/expr_spine/tests/type_lit_adversarial_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/expr_spine (type literal) — the red team / names against names / an `interned` whose seat is no enum refuses at the variant	features/expr_spine/tests/type_lit_adversarial_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/fns — a record spread into named seats / refusals / a field and an argument pinning one type parameter differently	features/fns/tests/spread_named_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/fns — variadic seat / refusals / a spread of another element type	features/fns/tests/variadic_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/impls adversarial / trait defaults under attack / a default reading a field of `self` refuses — `Self` has no fields, only the trait's members	features/impls/tests/impls_adversarial_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/impls — a trait member's seat default / the default / is judged against its seat	features/impls/tests/trait_seat_defaults_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/impls/statics / a bodied associated fn — the trait's own name is a receiver too / an abstract one has no single body to answer through the trait	features/impls/tests/statics_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/impls/statics / the receiver a static does not have / a bodied associated fn's signature names no `Self`	features/impls/tests/statics_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/lists/fold — the seats under attack / the seed / a null with no declared answer names no type	features/lists/tests/fold_get_adversarial_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/maps — spread, adversarial / refusals / a source of another value type	features/maps/tests/spread_map_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/maps/adversarial / every wrong type at every seat — one refusal each / a bare `{}` has no length yet — a declared type gives it one	features/maps/tests/maps_adversarial_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/maps/adversarial / the malformed literal — a diagnostic every time, counts pinned / missing colon, missing value, missing key, double comma, unclosed	features/maps/tests/maps_adversarial_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/results / `catch` — recovery at four granularities / a `Result` side of `void` waits, in the row's words	features/results/tests/results_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/results / construction by name — the language's own declaration / a want that is another generic pins nothing	features/results/tests/results_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/results / construction by name — the language's own declaration / with nothing to pin the other side, it refuses	features/results/tests/results_test.av lane-parity-types .194
