features/tasks (adversarial) / every seat past the block / a generic record instantiated over a task	features/tasks/tests/tasks_adversarial_test.av lane-parity-types .194
features/tasks (adversarial) / every seat past the block / a task's own answer	features/tasks/tests/tasks_adversarial_test.av lane-parity-types .194
